FILE_DESCRIPTION(
/* description */ (
'Camera target for the XIAO ESP32-S3 Sense: hangs in an openUC2 cube f
rom the top (cap on four corner bosses), camera module in a square sea
t on the cube axis, board slid in from the back, USB-C from the top. F
DM, print upside down on the cap, no supports. Magnets 8x3: 2 front, 2
 foot.'),
/* implementation_level */ '2;1');

